<title>HONG KONG: Sinar Mas unit launches US$50 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Sinar Mas unit launches US$50 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Deutsche Morgan Grenfell Singapore.</p>
<p>BORROWER SINAR MAS FINANCE CO</p>
<p>GUARANTOR SINAR MAS MULTIARTHA</p>
<p> AMT	US$50 MLN   COUPON    6ML+137.5  MATURITY    3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	   ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    26.AUG.96</p>
<p> PUTS     YRS 1,2     CALLS     NONE	 REPLIES     12.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	US$250K</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	  SALE LMTS HK/SING/UK/US NOT 144A</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA2</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY INDONESIA  PAY DATE    26.SEP.96</p>
<p> NOTES    OFF US$250 MLN ASIAN CURRENCY NOTE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>	    GUARANTEED BY SINAR MAS MULTIARTHA</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	    JOINT ARRANGERS/LEADS US$10 MLN+ 25.5 BP ALL-IN 163</p>
<p>	    CO-LEAD MANAGERS	US$5-7 MLN 22.5 BP ALL-IN 160</p>
<p>	    CO-MANAGERS	     US$3   MLN 18.5 BP ALL-IN 156</p>
<p>ARRANGER DEUTSCHE MORGAN GRENFELL SINGAPORE (BOOKS)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
